    "title": "Sunnova",
    "description": "The Sunnova App puts homeowners in control of their home energy by combining modern energy appliances, including solar, storage, and electric vehicles, in one, convenient app. Users can manage their devices; view hourly, daily, and monthly performance; and discover new ways to optimize their home. As the central place for managing a new kind of home energy ecosystem, Sunnova enables homeowners to manage and optimize their Sunnova Adaptive Home\u2122.",
